        "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Cost</strong> nothing · <strong>Requirements</strong> You are in <strong>Severance</strong></p><hr /><p><em>Panther King's Claw.</em> Your claws extend into ten blades of condensed reishi and you throw all of them.</p><p><strong>60-foot cone</strong>, basic Reflex, <strong>slashing</strong> damage.</p><p>Creatures that fail take <strong>4d6 persistent bleed</strong>.</p><hr /><p><em>Canon has Grimmjow name this his strongest attack, which is why it sits here rather than in his Segunda Etapa.</em></p><hr /><p><strong>Waning.</strong> The damage is <strong>20d6</strong> if used in the first round of Severance, and two dice fewer each round after &mdash; 18d6, 16d6, 14d6, 12d6, 10d6, and <strong>8d6</strong> in the seventh. After the seventh round this cannot be used at all.</p><p><strong>Using this ends Severance</strong>, whether you want it to or not.</p>"
